- Perfect his archery skills to legendary status
## Appearance & Physical State
Faendal has the typical Bosmer features: shorter than most humans, slender build, slightly pointed ears, and angular facial features with pronounced cheekbones. His eyes reflect the natural amber-green common to Wood Elves, and his skin has the characteristic tan-copper tone of his race. His movements are nimble and precise, reflecting his hunter's training.
## Skills & Combat
- Expert archery with exceptional accuracy at long distances
- Skilled hunter with knowledge of tracking, skinning, and butchering
